  title: Gupta science
  text: Aryabhata proposed that the earth rotates on its axis and explained eclipses scientifically. Varahamihira wrote the Brihat Samhita on astronomy and natural science. Metalworkers produced the rust-resistant Iron Pillar that now stands in Delhi.
